{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_88","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented the early registered forwarding-select path in `cores/bench/rtl`.\n\nKey points:\n- `forward_unit` now computes decode-time selects from current `ID/EX` and `EX/MEM` metadata.\n- `id_stage` latches those selects into `id_ex_t`.\n- `ex_stage` uses the registered selects directly, with trap-aware write-enable validation and dmem-stall-safe MEM/WB forwarding.\n- Added notes at `cores/bench/implementation_notes.md`.\n\nVerification:\n- `verilator --lint-only -Wall -Wno-MULTITOP -sv +incdir+cores/bench/rtl cores/bench/rtl/*.sv` passed.\n- `RTL_DIR=cores/bench/rtl CORE_NAME=bench bash formal/run_all.sh` passed: `53 passed, 0 failed`.\n- `NRET=1 make cosim TARGET=bench` passed: `2` ELFs tested.\n\nOne local quirk: plain `make cosim TARGET=bench` builds the harness with `NRET=2` in this checkout, so I reran it with `NRET=1` to match `cores/bench/core.yaml`."}}
