{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"One correctness wrinkle surfaced: this core currently reports raw instruction bitfields as RVFI source registers even for encodings that do not actually read them. To safely remove those false stalls, I’m also going to make the retired RVFI source addresses/data reflect real source usage, with stores still reporting their data operand after the late bypass."}}
