{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"agent_message","text":"That gives the predictor tests a sharper fence: aligned JALs redirect immediately in both directions, JALR remains EX-resolved, misaligned JAL still traps, and an illegal non-JAL opcode stays sequential. I’m moving to lint now before the heavier formal gate."}}
