eback behavior. This removes the\\ngeneric ALU case/output mux from the hot dmem address path without changing\\npipeline depth, bus handshakes, RVFI retirement, or CoreMark-visible memory\\nsemantics.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a dedicated memory effective-address field to the EX/MEM bundle so memory address timing n\n…[25603 of 28675 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:09f61cb47a9e78eb]…\ne address or an ALU/branch operand.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 142.35, \"delta_pct\": -1.34, \"vs_baseline\": 1074.5, \"fmax_mhz\": 63.432, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4456111, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2998, \"ff\": 848, \"seeds\": [59.845, 63.432, 63.432], \"perturbations\": [[0, 59.845, 13], [1, 63.432, 15], [2, 63.432, 15]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/instr0_q_3_s2\", \"slack_ns\": -11.71, \"arrival_ns\": 22.004, \"logic_cells\": 23, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T13:31:52.324909Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 7, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-001-r7s0 (regression, -1.34%): Operand-role-aware load-use stalls plus a WB-to-MEM store-data bypass regressed because CoreMark has too few load-to-store-data pairs to repay opcode predecode and MEM-stage compare/mux cost.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
