"Use the registered ID/EX forwarding selects directly for operand muxing.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Retarget or replace the forwarding helper so it computes early next-cycle selects instead of same-cycle EX selects.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
