ate. That means a\\nsame-cycle forwarding comparison is controlling the ALU input path and\\ndirectly limiting Fmax, while contributing no useful IPC improvement beyond\\nordinary bypass correctness.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Move forwarding hit detection one stage earlier and latch the selected\\nbypass source with the ID/EX payload. For an instruction being decoded,\\ncompare its rs1/rs2 against the producer currently in ID/EX, which will be\\nEX/MEM when the\n…[108981 of 112053 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:510fcdcca2716aad]…\n\": 59.513, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4406210, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3041, \"ff\": 871, \"seeds\": [52.361, 59.513, 59.513], \"perturbations\": [[0, 52.361, 17], [1, 59.513, 15], [2, 59.513, 15]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/instr1_q_21_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -14.098, \"arrival_ns\": 24.392, \"logic_cells\": 42, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 17, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T13:46:27.566672Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 8, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-003-r8s2 (regression, -6.39%): Carrying an early direct-JAL target into ID/EX and suppressing the EX redirect still regresses because the expensive part remains the accepted-JAL ID-to-IF target-add/alignment/FIFO-flush path, while `early_jal_target` widens ID/EX and adds EX jump-target muxing for little CoreMark call/jump benefit.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
