ayload.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the latched PC-relative target for branches, JAL, AUIPC results, pc_next, and target-alignment traps while retaining the forwarded rs1+imm path for JALR and memory addresses.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the widened ID/EX bundle through the existing single-retire pipeline without changing top-level IO or nret=1 RVFI behavior.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
