file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Refactor execute into EXA operand capture plus EXB ALU/branch/address/muldiv completion, preserving existing RVFI payload generation at the EX/MEM boundary.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Update stall, bubble, and redirect handling for the extra execute substage, including the longer load-use case and flush of younger wrong-path EXA/ID instructions.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Retarget forwarding decisions around the EXA latch so ALU results can bypass into operand capture while loads wait until data is available.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the split execute stage and revised hazard/forwarding signals without changing the nret=1 top-level IO contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
