ields needed to mark an instruction as a held RV32M operation and preserve its RVFI payload while the unit runs.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Reduce the combinational ALU to the fast RV32I operations and ALTOPS-compatible simple M stand-ins for formal builds.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/muldiv_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a new sequential RV32M unit with registered mul\n…[137242 of 140314 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:4ab5196b2851145f]…\nrovement\", \"fitness\": 154.29, \"delta_pct\": 6.93, \"vs_baseline\": 1173.02, \"fmax_mhz\": 67.985, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4406210, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2996, \"ff\": 838, \"seeds\": [62.627, 67.985, 67.985], \"perturbations\": [[0, 62.627, 13], [1, 67.985, 13], [2, 67.985, 13]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/instr0_q_29_s2\", \"slack_ns\": -10.967, \"arrival_ns\": 21.262, \"logic_cells\": 34, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T14:43:05.933377Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-003-r11s2 (improvement, +6.93%): Direct-JAL decode redirects can pay on CoreMark when they are metadata-free, flush only the IF FIFO, and suppress the duplicate EX redirect for aligned JALs instead of carrying prediction repair bits through ID/EX or the hazard squash path.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
