improving the fitness product.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 22, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add execute-stage state/control fields needed to mark an instruction as a held RV32M operation and preserve its RVFI payload while the unit runs.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Reduce the combinational ALU to the fast RV32I operations and ALTOPS-compatib\n…[180451 of 183523 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:fc656cd962594c99]…\nession\", \"fitness\": 146.6, \"delta_pct\": -4.98, \"vs_baseline\": 1109.57, \"fmax_mhz\": 62.113, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4236938, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3009, \"ff\": 838, \"seeds\": [58.409, 62.113, 62.113], \"perturbations\": [[0, 58.409, 16], [1, 62.113, 17], [2, 62.113, 17]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/instr0_q_6_s2\", \"slack_ns\": -12.121, \"arrival_ns\": 22.415, \"logic_cells\": 40, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T15:41:58.490800Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 14, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-003-r14s2 (regression, -4.98%): Even metadata-free backward-branch decode redirects regressed because `dec_is_branch && imm[31]` ID-to-IF redirect gating plus EX fallthrough-repair/taken-redirect muxing cost more than CoreMark's saved loop-back bubbles.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
