only on prediction mismatch, and emit BTB training information for valid conditional branches and direct JALs.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire predictor lookup/training signals between IF and EX without changing the nret=1 top-level IO contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
