kg.sv\n    description: \"Add ID/EX fields for an early direct-JAL marker and its carried target, keeping the nret=1 RVFI contract unchanged.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Recognize accepted direct JALs, compute the aligned pc-plus-J-immediate target, request the early fetch redirect, and latch the carried target.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Accept a decode-stage direct-JAL redirect that flushes younger queued sequential entries and restarts fetch at the carried target.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"For marked direct JALs, use the carried target for pc_next and suppress the normal EX redirect without adding a full predicted-next-PC mismatch compare.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the decode-stage direct-JAL redirect and target-carry metadata through the existing single-retire pipeline.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
